1
00:00:00,038 --> 00:00:01,838
(Bernadette:)Well, thanks again.

2
00:00:01,839 --> 00:00:02,939
(Sheldon:)You're welcome.

3
00:00:02,941 --> 00:00:04,371
(Sheldon:)And any time you need a break

4
00:00:04,375 --> 00:00:05,775
(Sheldon:)from being
Bernadette the Pregnant,

5
00:00:05,777 --> 00:00:07,977
(Sheldon:)Bernatrix the Warrior Queen
is here waiting.

6
00:00:07,979 --> 00:00:09,949
(Bernadette:)I might just take
you up on that.

7
00:00:09,948 --> 00:00:11,278
(Sheldon:)Well, mind you now,

8
00:00:11,282 --> 00:00:13,712
(Sheldon:)that offer's only good
until the third trimester.

9
00:00:13,718 --> 00:00:17,458
(Sheldon:)I can't risk getting
amniotic fluid on my spot.

10
00:00:19,557 --> 00:00:22,997
(Raj:)Hey, dude, you're
killing me with Claire.

11
00:00:22,994 --> 00:00:24,064
(Zack:)What are you talking about?

12
00:00:24,062 --> 00:00:26,632
(scoffs) I mean,
come on, look at you.

13
00:00:26,631 --> 00:00:29,661
(Raj:)You're classically handsome,
you've got a swimmer's body.

14
00:00:29,667 --> 00:00:32,867
(Raj:)Next to you,
I look like me.

15
00:00:32,870 --> 00:00:35,940
(Zack:)Oh, man,
I didn't mean to do that.

16
00:00:35,940 --> 00:00:38,980
(Zack:)But I do appreciate you
recognizing my swimmer's body.

17
00:00:38,977 --> 00:00:41,207
(Zack:)Which, incidentally,

18
00:00:41,212 --> 00:00:44,282
(Zack:)I got from playing
Marco Polo at the YMCA.

19
00:00:46,317 --> 00:00:49,047
(Raj:)Yeah, okay, just...
do me a favor

20
00:00:49,053 --> 00:00:51,853
(Raj:)and stop talking about
how great Claire is.

21
00:00:51,856 --> 00:00:55,026
(Zack:)Anything for you,
my little foreign friend.

22
00:00:56,261 --> 00:00:57,661
(Claire:)So, I got to ask,

23
00:00:57,662 --> 00:01:00,022
(Claire:)does Raj bring around
other girls?

